  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: "51 · Stylized water shader"
  description: "Stylised water: colour, fog and foam lines come from the difference between the scene depth and the water depth, two panning normal maps add detail, and fresnel drives transparency. Interactive ripples: particles on a dedicated layer (WaterRipples) are rendered by an orthographic top-down camera into a RenderTexture, which the water samples in world space to offset its normals and remove foam."
  controls: "Press Play to see the boat ripples\nRight mouse drag: orbit · Wheel: zoom · Middle mouse drag: pan\nN / B: next / previous demo · M: menu · H: hide this panel"
  showPanel: 1
